<title>USA: Adelphia Communications sets 144a notes.</title>
<headline>Adelphia Communications sets 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Adelphia Communciations Corp was priced in the 144a private placement market on Friday, according to sole manager Smith Barney.</p>
<p>The deal was increased to $350 million from $200 million due to increased investor demand, sources said.</p>
<p>BORROWER ADELPHIA COMMUNICATIONS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $35O MLN	 COUPON 9.875 PCT  MATURITY 3/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.217  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.00 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 364.3 BPS  CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
